# KPI Definitions

| KPI | Business Purpose |
|---|---|
| Total Assets | Measure overall balance-sheet growth |
| Customer Deposits | Measure customer funding growth |
| Customer Loans | Measure lending growth |
| Operating Income | Measure income generation |
| Operating Expenses | Assess operating cost growth and efficiency |
| Profit After Tax | Measure overall profitability |
| ROAA | Measure profitability relative to assets |
| ROAE | Measure returns generated on shareholders' equity |
| Gross NPL Ratio | Assess credit risk and asset quality |
| Loan Loss Coverage | Assess the bank's provision coverage for credit risk |
| Liquidity Ratio | Assess liquidity and short-term financial resilience |